<!--
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║ CODEMPOSE MUSICXML EXPORT - FUGUE WITH STAGGERED VOICE ENTRIES            ║
╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
║                                                                            ║
║ ⚠️  IMPORTANT: MUSESCORE SEQUENTIAL IMPORT ISSUE                          ║
║                                                                            ║
║ MuseScore imports MusicXML parts SEQUENTIALLY (one after another).        ║
║ This fugue needs SIMULTANEOUS playback with staggered voice entries.      ║
║                                                                            ║
║ VOICE ENTRY TIMING (as composed):                                         ║
║                                                                            ║
║   • Soprano: Starts at Measure 1  (Subject)                               ║
║   • Alto:    Starts at Measure 5  (Answer, +4 measures offset)            ║
║   • Tenor:   Starts at Measure 9  (Countersubject, +8 measures offset)    ║
║   • Bass:    Starts at Measure 13 (Augmentation, +12 measures offset)     ║
║                                                                            ║
║ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════║
║ RECOMMENDED: IMPORT MIDI FILE INSTEAD                                     ║
║ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════║
║                                                                            ║
║ The accompanying .midi file has ABSOLUTE TIMING and imports correctly:    ║
║                                                                            ║
║   1. Open newfugue.midi in MuseScore                                      ║
║   2. Voices automatically play simultaneously with correct offsets         ║
║   3. Export from MuseScore as MusicXML if needed                          ║
║                                                                            ║
║ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════║
║ MANUAL FIX FOR MUSICXML IMPORT (if you must use this file):               ║
║ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════║
║                                                                            ║
║ After importing this MusicXML file:                                       ║
║                                                                            ║
║   1. Select Alto staff (entire system)                                    ║
║   2. Insert → Measures → Add 4 empty measures at START                    ║
║   3. Select Tenor staff                                                   ║
║   4. Insert → Measures → Add 8 empty measures at START                    ║
║   5. Select Bass staff                                                    ║
║   6. Insert → Measures → Add 12 empty measures at START                   ║
║                                                                            ║
║ Result: All voices now align correctly for simultaneous playback          ║
║                                                                            ║
║ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════║
║ ALTERNATIVE: VOICE COMBINING (for piano score layout)                     ║
║ ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════║
║                                                                            ║
║ After fixing timing (see above):                                          ║
║                                                                            ║
║   1. Select measures from Soprano + Alto staves                           ║
║   2. Tools → Implode                                                      ║
║   3. Delete empty Alto staff                                              ║
║   4. Repeat for Tenor + Bass → lower staff                                ║
║                                                                            ║
║ This creates a traditional 2-staff piano score with voices 1-2 on top     ║
║ staff and voices 3-4 on bottom staff.                                     ║
║                                                                            ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
-->

